      "role": "user",
      "content": "the response from the board is gonna be pretty skeptical though. many executives argue that DEI is just a distraction from meritocracy and that there's no actual data connecting diversity to a better bottom line. how do you address the argument that these programs are just expensive optics that actually hurt performance by prioritizing identity over skill?",
